  "plain": "i can't tell you why\n[00:13.58]but something inside\n[00:16.09]is dancing with fire\n[00:20.10]eyes lit like the sky\n[00:23.54]turned tears into diamonds\n[00:26.09]got good at goodbyes\n[00:27.96]just know that i will find my way from you\n[00:32.29]like flowers from a tomb\n[00:34.55]while you decide who you are\n[00:38.57]and i can see right through\n[00:42.30]like shadows on the moon\n[00:44.51]and it's all bad news\n[00:47.99]♡ yeah, i, i, i\n[00:50.07]hate that i made you love me\n[00:55.02]sorry if i made me your type\n[00:58.60]yeah, i, i hate that i made you love me\n[01:04.20]'cause i barely tried\n[01:07.91]yeah, i, i, i\n[01:10.09]what's happening now?\n[01:13.54]you studied my crown\n[01:16.09]and borrowed my body\n[01:20.01]warm, kissed by the sun\n[01:23.56]then cold like the wind\n[01:26.04]a bee stuck in honey\n[01:28.26]know that i will find my way from you (my way from you)\n[01:32.31]i guess it's kinda cute\n[01:34.52]how you like me where you are\n[01:38.59]but i can see right through (right through)\n[01:42.27]just don't eclipse the moon\n[01:44.52]'cause it's all bad news\n[01:48.02]♡ yeah, i, i, i\n[01:50.05]hate that i made you love me\n[01:54.99]sorry if i made me your type\n[01:58.56]yeah, i, i hate that i made you love me (hate that i made you)\n[02:04.17]'cause i barely tried\n[02:07.94]yeah, i, i, i (ooh, ooh, yeah)\n[02:13.04]i've held your projections when you've felt so insecure\n[02:16.97]tell me, why is it this way?\n[02:18.84]why you so hate to see women endure?\n[02:22.26]is it really my fault you all gave me your hearts\n[02:24.75]of your own accord?\n[02:27.31]i don't really think so\n[02:31.43]i, i\n[02:32.61]hate that i made you love me (you love me, baby)\n[02:37.53]sorry if i made me your type\n[02:41.07]yeah, i, i hate that i made you love me\n[02:46.65]'cause i barely tried\n[02:50.45]♡ yeah, i, i, i\n[02:52.57]hate that i made you love me (baby)\n[02:57.53]sorry if i made me your type (sorry if i made me your type)\n[03:01.06]yeah, i, i hate that i made you love me\n[03:06.64]'cause i barely tried\n[03:10.45]yeah, i, i, i"
